# Git commits and pushes

Apply this whenever you commit or push.

- Commit only when the user asks. Push only when the user asks.
- Subject line only, or one short sentence after it. Say why, in plain language.
- No Co-authored-by trailer. No Cursor, Cursor Agent, or any AI co-author line.
- No "Generated with", "Made with Cursor", or similar footers.
- Do not pass `--trailer`, and do not append a trailer in the message body.

```
# Bad
Add 100BM screens

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

# Good
Add 100BM and MBW journey screens.
```
